        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Spicer · 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "A Spicer alternative.<br><em>From conversation to audio.</em>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Looking for a voice to guide your time together rather than a list of questions? Caresse offers audio fiction for couples, listened to in the app."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group"
              },
              "html": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download for free</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Guest mode · Free demos · iOS and Android<br>Paid personalised sessions, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "In short"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Find shared desires or listen to a session?"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "tldr-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Spicer helps couples explore preferences with questions and matched answers. Caresse offers guided audio fiction: it is not a preference-matching system. Spicer also offers dares and AI."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict",
            "id": "verdict"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Comparison"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Spicer"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table-wrap",
                "tabindex": "0",
                "role": "region",
                "aria-label": "Caresse vs Spicer"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "verdict-table"
                  },
                  "html": "<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\">Caresse</th><th scope=\"col\">Spicer</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Format</th><td class=\"caresse\">Guided audio fiction</td><td class=\"other\">Questions, matches and dares</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Preferences</th><td class=\"caresse\">Session setup in the app</td><td class=\"other\">Yes, maybe or no answers</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Partner connection</th><td class=\"caresse\">Duo session; not a couple chat</td><td class=\"other\">Partners linked by code</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Languages</th><td class=\"caresse\">Audio in EN, FR, ES and PT; PT UI partly translated</td><td class=\"other\">Questions and dares in multiple languages</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">AI</th><td class=\"caresse\">Narrated sessions created in the app</td><td class=\"other\">Spicer AI suggests activities from matches</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Pricing</th><td class=\"caresse\">Free demos; credits, no subscription</td><td class=\"other\">Free base; paid packs and advanced options</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Solo use</th><td class=\"caresse\">Available</td><td class=\"other\">A couples-focused product</td></tr>\n</tbody>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group",
                "style": "margin-top:32px"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "a",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US",
                    "class": "cta-pink",
                    "data-store-auto": "",
                    "data-cta-position": "inline",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "rel": "noopener"
                  },
                  "html": "Download for free"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Two formats"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Discuss preferences or listen to fiction?"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "columns-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p><h3>Audio at the centre of the moment.</h3><p>Caresse creates a guided audio fiction in the app from your preferences. A synthetic voice carries the narration; you remain free to pause, skip a suggestion or stop.</p><p>This website does not generate sessions. Demos are pre-generated examples; sessions created in the app are paid.</p><ul><li>A guided audio fiction, without reading cards during the session.</li><li>A solo or duo format, narrated by a synthetic voice.</li><li>Credits instead of a subscription.</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card muted"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Spicer</p><h3>Questions to discover common ground.</h3><p>Spicer uses answers to show shared interests. Each partner takes part on their own phone, linked by a code. The format centres on questions, dares and conversation.</p><p>The publisher advertises multilingual questions and dares, plus Spicer AI. We do not describe Spicer as an app without AI or free access.</p><ul><li>Explore questions with yes, maybe or no answers.</li><li>See shared preferences and discuss them.</li><li>Link partners by code, including between iOS and Android.</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Pricing and access"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Free does not mean everything is included."
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Caresse</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Credits, no subscription</p><p class=\"price-note\">Free download and demos. Creating a session in the app uses a paid credit.</p><p class=\"price-note\">An optional advanced-options unlock is sold separately; it does not include unlimited generation.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Spicer</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Free base</p><p class=\"price-note\">Spicer’s website advertises free use with optional paid advanced question packs. Other paid options may appear in the store or app.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Prices and offers vary by country and store. Check the terms shown before you buy. <a href=\"/en/pricing/\">Pricing Caresse</a>."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Published by Caresse using public publisher information checked on 10 October 2026. This is not an independent hands-on review. Sources: Official Spicer website and FAQ · Spicer on the App Store"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "By your preference"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Which format fits you?"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "choose-card us"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3><ul><li>A guided audio fiction, without reading cards during the session.</li><li>A solo or duo format, narrated by a synthetic voice.</li><li>Credits instead of a subscription.</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "choose-card them"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Choose Spicer if you want…</h3><ul><li>Explore questions with yes, maybe or no answers.</li><li>See shared preferences and discuss them.</li><li>Link partners by code, including between iOS and Android.</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Frequently asked questions"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Answers before you choose."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Does Caresse match preferences like Spicer?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Spicer compares answers to show shared interests. Caresse creates guided audio fiction from session preferences. It does not advertise a matching system or partner chat."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is Spicer free?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "The official website advertises a free base and optional paid advanced question packs. Also check the options and terms in your store and in the app."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Does Spicer have multilingual content and AI?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Its official website advertises questions and dares in English, German, Russian, French, Portuguese, Spanish and Dutch. Spicer AI is described as suggesting activities from a couple’s matches."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Which Spicer alternative offers audio guidance?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Caresse offers fiction guided by a synthetic voice, solo or as a couple. Downloading and demos are free; creating sessions in the app uses paid credits."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Are Caresse’s personalised sessions free?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Downloading the app and listening to demos are free. Creating a session in the app uses a paid credit, with no subscription. The optional advanced-options unlock is separate."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
